<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#A15.SS0.SSS0.Px3" title="In Appendix O Experiment: Graph Generation ‣ On Powerful Ways to Generate: Autoregression, Diffusion, and Beyond" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">ARM Baseline</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_appendix"><a href="#A16" title="In On Powerful Ways to Generate: Autoregression, Diffusion, and Beyond" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">P </span>Experiment: Parity</span></a>
<ol class="ltx_toclist ltx_toclist_appendix">
