<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#A16.SS0.SSS0.Px2" title="In Appendix P Experiment: Parity ‣ On Powerful Ways to Generate: Autoregression, Diffusion, and Beyond" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Data</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#A16.SS0.SSS0.Px3" title="In Appendix P Experiment: Parity ‣ On Powerful Ways to Generate: Autoregression, Diffusion, and Beyond" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">ARM Baseline</span></a></li>
