<div id="A15.SS0.SSS0.Px3.p2" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A15.SS0.SSS0.Px3.p2.1" class="ltx_p">As shown in <a href="#A15.T1" title="In ARM Baseline ‣ Appendix O Experiment: Graph Generation ‣ On Powerful Ways to Generate: Autoregression, Diffusion, and Beyond" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Table</span> <span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">1</span></a>, the sequence length grows with graph size for both AP-MDM and ARM, but ARM requires significantly longer sequences due to the explicit operation enumeration.</p>
</div>
